    "detailed_description": "Marudachi is an action puzzle game. In the game, you help different Maru to get the star and go to the goal. Every Maru has its abilities. With those abilities, Maru help each other to get into the place they can't go on their own.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNormal Play:<br />\r\nOn every level, there is a normal star. Get the normal star and let all Maru stay on the yellow platform is what all you need to do. With different Maru's abilities, some levels may have multiple ways to get to the goal. <br />\r\nTips: U and O are very useful. Try to find more ways to clear easier levels, it will help you understand what Marus can do.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSecret Star:<br />\r\nOn every level, there is a secret star. The secret stars need a Maru to stay in a specific place for two seconds to get them. The secret stars are hidden in the place Maru don't usually stay or get into. Some secret stars are required to get with specific Maru only too. It is recommended that you start finding the secret stars after you have completed the normal play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n~ 50 Levels<br />\r\n~ Secret Stars<br />\r\n~ 7 Maru<br />\r\n~ Achievements<br />\r\n~ Simple Graphic",
    "about_the_game": "Marudachi is an action puzzle game. In the game, you help different Maru to get the star and go to the goal. Every Maru has its abilities. With those abilities, Maru help each other to get into the place they can't go on their own.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNormal Play:<br />\r\nOn every level, there is a normal star. Get the normal star and let all Maru stay on the yellow platform is what all you need to do. With different Maru's abilities, some levels may have multiple ways to get to the goal. <br />\r\nTips: U and O are very useful. Try to find more ways to clear easier levels, it will help you understand what Marus can do.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSecret Star:<br />\r\nOn every level, there is a secret star. The secret stars need a Maru to stay in a specific place for two seconds to get them. The secret stars are hidden in the place Maru don't usually stay or get into. Some secret stars are required to get with specific Maru only too. It is recommended that you start finding the secret stars after you have completed the normal play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n~ 50 Levels<br />\r\n~ Secret Stars<br />\r\n~ 7 Maru<br />\r\n~ Achievements<br />\r\n~ Simple Graphic",
